      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but that feels like such a cope. like, saying it's \"precious\" just because it's temporary doesn't change the fact that everything we do is just delaying the inevitable. it's like building a sandcastle right before the tide comes in. why go through the stress and the constant emotional noise if the outcome is always just going to be zero? it just feels like we're all just performing a play for an audience that doesn't exist.",
